  "detail_text": "3/18/2026 UPDATE: The current forecasted solicitation release is now April 8, 2026 but subject to change. A follow up posting to this SAM.gov notice will be posted at least one week prior to formally soliciting on GSA MAS. Please continue to follow this SAM.gov oppportuntiny for futher updates until formal solicitation is posted to GSA MAS. Reactivating SAM.gov notice until formal soliciation is posted to GSA MAS. The purpose is to clarify based on market research this effort will be formal solicited under the GSA MAS, specifically category 54151S under NAICS 541519 as a 100% SDVOSB Set-aside. At this time, the current forecasted release date is March 20, 2026. However, this is subject to change and a follow up posting to this SAM.gov notice will be posted at least one week prior to formally soliciting on GSA MAS. Initial posting information: The purpose of this updated notice to source sought posting 36C10B25Q0471 it to inform all interested parties that based on review of the market research, The Department of Veterans Affairs (VA) anticipates the subject requirement to be released on GSA MAS as a 100% SDVOSB Set-aside. See attachments.",
